\frac{H_0^{\mathrm{local}}}{H_0^{\mathrm{CMB\,inferido}}} \;=\;
\left(\frac{T_{\mathrm{GH}}(T_0)}{T_{\mathrm{GH}}(T_*)}\right)^{\bTGL} =
